# SHELVED, out of the build. Delete `note draft` to bring it back.
#
# Superseded by `code/exception.tree`, which is the current design: every
# exception is a form that is `like exception` and PINS its `note` to a fixed
# category, with the part that varies per occurrence in its own field.
#
# This module predates that and does not fit it, in two ways that are not
# one-line fixes:
#
#   `form error` is a plain record, and `task throw` raises it. A raised form
#   has to be `like exception`. Making it one then requires a pinned `note`,
#   but `task make` takes the message from its caller and writes it to `note`,
#   and a pinned field cannot be given.
#
#   `make error` in `task catch` and `task fail` means the RESULT variant
#   `error` from `code/result`, not `form error` in this file. Names are
#   package-global, so the two collide. `bind value` belongs to the variant
#   and does not exist on the form.
#
# `catch` WAS THE ONLY THING HERE WORTH KEEPING, and it has been moved to
# `code/result.tree`, where there is one `error` and it is the right one.
# Nothing else is lost by shelving this: `make` and `throw` are superseded by
# `code/exception.tree`, and `wrap` and `fail` are `make okay` and
# `make error` written out.
#
# Nothing imports `@term/seed/code/error`, so shelving it costs nothing today.
# What it should become is a design decision: either drop it in favour of
# `exception.tree`, or rebuild it on top of that with the message in its own
# field and the result variant renamed out of the collision.
#
# It compiled until now only because a stale build cache was serving it. The
# rule that rejects it, `deck/make/code/check/extend.ts`, is new and correct.

note draft

load @term/seed/code/base/result
  find result

form error
  link code, like text
  link note, like text
  link hint, like text

task make
  take code, like text
  take message, like text
  take hint, like text, need false
  like error
  send back
    make error
      bind code, read code
      bind note, read message
      bind hint, read hint

task throw
  take error, like error
  halt error, read error

task catch
  take work, like task
  like result
  note unsafe
    save value
      call work
    send back
      make okay
        bind value, read value
  halt take
    take error
    send back
      make error
        bind value, read error

task wrap
  take data
  like result
  send back
    make okay
      bind value, read data

task fail
  take error, like error
  like result
  send back
    make error
      bind value, read error
